out/eval/

# Autoloop runtime state (state.json, transcript.jsonl, diagnostics/, PAUSE).
# Config lives here too and may reference a private conversation URL.
#
# NOTE THE LEADING DOT. This is the loop's STATE AND CONFIG directory, not the
# `autoloop/` package. The package is a separate project and is on its way out
# of this checkout; this entry is NOT part of that removal and must outlive it.
# The loop still runs against this repository as an external target and still
# reads `.autoloop/config.toml` from here, so deleting this line would put a
# private conversation URL and the loop's own state on the untracked list — and
# would make the checkout read as dirty to the loop itself.
.autoloop/

# Deliberately-untracked vendored copy of the nlp-histo extraction stage —
# reference-only for the ingestion design; deleted by roadmap A11 after the
# worker work upstreams. See docs/INGESTION_PIPELINE.md §9.
nlp_histo/
